{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127231331005-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127235612\"/><p>肇事兩車車頭損毀，Tesla安全氣袋彈出，橫亘路中。</p><p>今日(27日)晚上9時56分，一輛Tesla電動車沿西沙路行駛，至近瓦窰頭附近時，與一輛私家車相撞，兩車車頭均嚴重損毀，Tesla右頭轆撞至甩脫，安全氣袋彈出，橫亘路中。意外中，有兩人受傷。警員正調查意外起因。受事件影響，現場來回交通受阻現車龍。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:04:08.908356+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T15:13:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:57:16.433854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:57:16.433854+00:00","content_hash":"651c6f7a1610b9c9e62bfd7b1e3a6d512b149da42c9631d7b09b38482c2ccf4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}